# Netlify rules. Replace YOUR-BACKEND with your Render service name (see docs/FREE_HOSTING.md).
# The first two lines pass API calls through the website's own address, so customer logins work without a custom domain.
/api/*        https://YOUR-BACKEND.onrender.com/api/:splat   200
/sitemap.xml  https://YOUR-BACKEND.onrender.com/sitemap.xml  200
/*            /index.html                                    200
